  "scope": "Separate 87-object/91-entry candidate adds actual ordinary-volume serialization, a bounded PID-1 process-context mount coordinator and a C bridge using the real generated syscall structure. A separate kern_exec overlay calls the bounded gate after init scratch allocation and before launchd loading. Default-off API checks selected seed identity, owners, original root identity and post-mount device/flags; it never claims root authentication or invokes mounting from the Data worker. The actual original-root boot and the full APFS runtime remain unqualified."
